# Did you win a 'Palmwoods Experience'?

We would like to thank everyone that completed a survey over the past few weeks. We have received so much helpful and encouraging feedback from you! and what you do (and don't) enjoy . It has really helped fine tune our plans for classes, camps and given us a fresh and spanking hot focus for 2017. So thank you for your time and contribution to making drum and dance more awesome!! We placed everyone's email that completed the survey into Nat's hat and pulled them out in this order from beginning to end. Play momentous drum roll now..........and here are the winners for our 'Experience Palmwoods' Survey Incentives: Congratulations to Simone Burridge you have won a 10' authentic West African Djembe valued at $200 from Rhythm Culture. Congratulations to Tina Rossiter you have won a Skin Microderm Facial Valued at $40 from Skin-Microdermabrasion & Beauty Therapy. Congratulations to Olga Rubio you have one a meal for two and coffee valued at $40 from Homegrown Cafe. Congratulations to Willy Van Alphen you have won two Large pizza's from PIZZA PIZZA valued at $35. Congratulations to Lyndal you have won dinner for two at Renaes Pantry on a Friday night. Join the open fires, live music, fairy lights, delicious desert bar and of course late night shopping at Renaes Pantry. Congratulations to Christine you have won a Mind and Body Balance with Tania Fechner, Kinesiologist from Balanced Beginnings. Congratulations to Samantha Cronar you have won a meal and coffee from Cocoa Tree Cafe. Congratulations to Judy Lewis you have won a 50% discount for cut and colour from Mane St Hair & Beauty. This survey was possible because of the generous support we received from all the businesses listed above. We would like to say a huge thank you to all of the businesses in Palmwoods that donated their products and services to our Rhythm Culture 2016 survey. The community support was so amazing and we couldn't of completed this with out you all!
